<title>ai-art-design-prompts</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; }
h1 { font-size: 18pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p>StartbusinessAI Prompt Pack: AI Art and Graphic Design<br><br>1. Creative Brief<br>Create a design brief for [client/business] needing [asset type].<br><br>2. Image Prompt<br>Write 10 image generation prompts for [visual goal] in [style].<br><br>3. Brand Kit<br>Suggest brand colors, typography direction, image style, and layout rules for [business].<br><br>4. Social Graphic<br>Create copy and visual direction for a social media graphic about [topic].<br><br>5. Etsy Product<br>Suggest 10 printable product ideas for [audience].<br><br>6. Mockup Copy<br>Write product listing copy for [design product].<br><br>7. Client Package<br>Package an AI-assisted design service for [niche].<br><br>8. Revision Prompt<br>Improve this design direction based on client feedback: [feedback].<br><br>9. Prompt Variations<br>Create 10 variations of this image prompt: [prompt].<br><br>10. Portfolio Sample<br>Create 5 portfolio sample ideas for an AI design service.<br><br>11. Usage Guide<br>Write a usage guide for a buyer downloading [design product].<br><br>12. Outreach<br>Write 5 outreach messages offering a design sample to [business type].<br></p>
</body>
</html>
